  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The games that pin a package build on 0.6.156.\nThe Bistro stands alone far from the level's rooms with the player carried into its street, its pack is made again without the archive's empty occlusion, and the script memory test reads after a full compacting collection.\nThe Amazon Lumberyard Bistro's exterior becomes a scene pack, its FBX turned into glTF by Blender in a container and set to its archive's texture convention, its manifest beside Sponza's, and the feature test loads it by scene.pack and takes its street by day and by night.",
